# The .vscode folder holds launch configurations, and ours carry RevenueCat
# API keys as --dart-define arguments. This repo goes public before the
# Shipaton deadline, so the folder is ignored rather than shared. Flutter's
# template leaves this line commented out; that default is wrong for us.
.vscode/

